<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set molasses import duties unchanged at zero, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The duties for both cane and beet molasses remain suspended,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The reference prices were fixed at 8.36 Ecus per 100 kg for cane and 12.20 Ecus per 100 kg for beet.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
